# L §5.19 One movement on two statements: a pair stated same is one movement, "its fulfils is stated on either row, or
# on both alike", so which row carries the link changes no answer. save is a decision measuring bal(konto) on the
# 15th; the link is on sav's row (bank[b1]) alone, konto's row (bank[a2]) stated same (M2 patch case P35, P50, T's
# probe p_rev_onefulfils): both rows are save[2026-03]'s observations, booked at its point, so it measures 1 050.00
# and its model is 950.00, as with the link on konto's row (E6_3_same_rows_ledger_once). refcore booked bank[a2] at
# konto before the decision (bal 100.00, model 0.00: konto's ledger difference -950.00, sav's +950.00).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-04-10
  start 2026-03-01
  end 2026-04-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
input bank: observed
input keep: money PLN
input d_save: int

move save[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, d_save)
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to sav amount max(0 PLN, bal(konto) - keep)

ask q_save: flows(save, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31)
ask q_led: residuals konto 2026-03
ask q_ls: residuals sav 2026-03

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  keep = 100.00 PLN "s"
  d_save = 15 "s"
  opening[konto] = 1050.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-01 start "s"

version st_konto
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-02
  covers konto
  bank[a2] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN) "a"

version st_sav
  cite s
  governs 2026-03
  known 2026-04-03
  covers sav
  bank[b1] = (on: 2026-03-15, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to sav amount 950.00 PLN, fulfils: save[2026-03]) "b"
  same bank[b1] = bank[a2]
=== expect
q_led: residuals konto 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model -950.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model -950.00 PLN, observed -950.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-04-10
q_ls: residuals sav 2026-03
  2026-03 move save: model 950.00 PLN, observed 950.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN
    matched save[2026-03] on 2026-03-15: model 950.00 PLN, observed 950.00 PLN, difference 0.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-04-10
q_save: 950.00 PLN
  cut 2026-04-10
